    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96">

                <pb facs="0199" n="123" sameAs="frus:frus1935v02/pg123"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5531/605</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Belgian Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Van Straten</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2674</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-06-28">June 28, 1935</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: By your letter dated the
                    twenty-seventh of this month,<anchor n="32" xml:id="d96-f1"/> Your Excellency
                    was kind enough to send me a new <pb facs="0200" n="124" xml:id="pg124"/> draft
                    for the general provisions which are to complete the Commercial Agreement
                    recently concluded between our two countries.</p>
                <p>I have the honor of advising Your Excellency that I have forwarded this proposal
                    to the King’s Government. As soon as the latter advises me of its point of view
                    on this subject, I shall hasten to inform Your Excellency thereof, and I hope,
                    as you do, that the last phase of our commercial negotiations will be terminated
                    very shortly.</p>
                <p>I take [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cte</hi>. R. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >v. Straten</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
